    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Theoden's Chosen bore this band through the gloom of the cave. Shadows cling to the iron, granting a ghostlike presence to the one who puts it on. It offers a sharp clarity of sight and a nimble grace of hand."
